  "$comment": "StudioAvailability truth table. One pure function per client; every entry point (tab / sidebar, deep links oriveo://studio/* and Web /studio/*, badge, chat \"open in studio\", relay probe image item) asks it and nothing else. compileFlag: iOS ORIVEO_STUDIO, Android BuildConfig.STUDIO_ENABLED, Web NEXT_PUBLIC_STUDIO_ENABLED (Release off until the shipping version). Remote flags live in /api/metadata runtimeConfig.featureFlags: studio_enabled (missing = true, only used to hide in an emergency, never to launch an unreviewed feature) and studio_managed_enabled (missing = false). imageDisabled is the managed protection switch image_disabled. managedInChatPicker: Chat image works are registered locally and Pro works sync regardless of the flags, so turning the entry on does not trigger a mass upload. Web serves /api/studio/* only when compiled on (otherwise 404). Executable reference: scripts/lib/studio-image-reference.mjs studioAvailability.",
